{'symbol': 'SWK', 'date': '2022-07-22 06:45:00', 'title': 'STANLEY BLACK & DECKER COMPLETES SALE OF SECURITY BUSINESS TO SECURITAS AB FOR $3.2 BILLION', 'text': "TRANSACTION FURTHER FOCUSES STANLEY BLACK & DECKER'S PORTFOLIO ON ITS CORE BUSINESSES NEW BRITAIN, CONN. , JULY 22, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- STANLEY BLACK & DECKER (NYSE: SWK) TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT IT HAS COMPLETED THE PREVIOUSLY ANNOUNCED SALE OF MOST OF ITS SECURITY ASSETS TO SECURITAS AB (STO: SECU B) FOR $3.2 BILLION IN CASH."}